OL,3,GNEWSADuck race postponed due to low
OL,4,Ariver levels
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rubber duck race held for almost two
OL,7,Fdecades has been postponed due to a
OL,8,Flack of water in a river.
OL,10,FThe annual charity event is hosted by
OL,11,Fthe University of Buckingham and takes
OL,12,Fplace on the River Great Ouse in
OL,13,FChandos Park in the town.
OL,15,FIn an announcement on Facebook,,
OL,16,Fexternal the university said it hoped
OL,17,Fto reschedule for the October
OL,18,Fhalf-term.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
