OL,3,GNEWSADuck race postponed due to low
OL,4,Ariver levels
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe race, which is open to everyone in
OL,7,Fthe town, the university alumni,
OL,8,Fstudents and staff, was scheduled to
OL,9,Ftake place on 25 August.
